{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748760/extras/705a024863f6a253059ebad90e6d3099.avif?t=1767773796\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748760/extras/c3f4e5f7120260778429b282a12a9aed.avif?t=1767773796\" width=309 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome Back to Bliss Valley!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're taking an extended vacation in the wonderful town of Bliss Valley, ready to enjoy all the amenities your hotel has to offer. A travel agent recommends that you check out the sights, sounds, and attractions of downtown Bliss Valley. The leisure district is full of unique locations to explore, interesting people to meet, and activities to dive into!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bliss Valley: After Dark</strong> is a mix between a choose-your-own-adventure visual novel and point &amp; click adventure RPG. While on your quest to meet and romance the anthro locals of downtown Bliss Valley, you'll encounter a variety of wacky characters, odd situations, dialogue options and quests. Level up your stats to increase your chances of success throughout your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748760/extras/5ad9ad7a6ddf79835afbe5832e2f91f1.avif?t=1767773796\" width=309 height=97 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>HEDONISM</u></strong><br>The <strong>HEDONISM </strong>stat is equivalent to your charm and sex appeal. With high enough<strong> HEDONISM, </strong>you can flirt your way into more intimate scenes with some characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>WRATH</u></strong><br><strong>WRATH</strong> is your physical strength and aggression. With high enough<strong> WRATH</strong>, no one will want to test your temper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PRIDE</u></strong><br>The<strong> PRIDE</strong> stat is akin to charisma. It's a safe bet that you can use your connections and intelligence to get your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>AVARICE</u></strong><br>With high<strong> AVARICE</strong>, you have the funds to spend on any amenity you please. You're also familiar with sweet-talking potential investors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>CHAOS</u></strong><br>The<strong> CHAOS</strong> stat is your unpredictability. With high enough<strong> CHAOS</strong>, you might encounter events and scenes you otherwise wouldn't!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748760/extras/a7af0e6ed6e92f88d51090003f6ec029.avif?t=1767773796\" width=309 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI Art/Dialogue/Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Dialogue Trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices &amp; Outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Characters to Romance &amp; Seduce</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Locations to Explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG Elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side Quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How will you spend your vacation in <i>Bliss Valley: After Dark</i>?</strong><br><br><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains explicit sexual content.<br><strong>All characters depicted are over the age of 21.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Bliss Valley","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3748760/cce416c0ed06e3dfc74e005cec32681b2e1f9b25.jpg"},{"name":"Quest Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3748760/1058c4a66bbbd0e8fc1d60f95e7a5ba4b3c669be.jpg"},{"name":"Quest Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3748760/00c7336a9659881f266628b20077a79670c3dc1c.jpg"},{"name":"Quest Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3748760/b772c5567af05bf688e2c47d5350e261f41b63d8.jpg"},{"name":"Killer Queen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3748760/7d79966e50832874982dc166601715e867b8ac3e.jpg"},{"name":"She's Got Beef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3748760/6b9f13a794567cd2d835734266a96bd5fe878b71.jpg"},{"name":"Pretty Rave Girl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3748760/b6fc85ffa5f542c96dfb16bdfa0529c255fa4961.jpg"},{"name":"Coulrophobia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3748760/6b9ca3958fd48044b860eade99c4b06a7c5238be.jpg"},{"name":"Bee-lieve in Yourself ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3748760/fffb7586cdfe4cdffdb200360a8d2305114f107e.jpg"},{"name":"Eviction Notice ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3748760/456a2153